WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.252
In wide form, January and February are separate columns.

00:00:04.252 --> 00:00:08.727
Now one row represents a product rather than a product-month.

00:00:08.727 --> 00:00:13.657
This can be convenient for scorecards, matrices, and fixed reports.

00:00:13.657 --> 00:00:19.247
The same business relationship is being displayed differently, but the row grain has changed.

00:00:19.247 --> 00:00:25.657
Long and wide are not labels for good and bad design; they are shapes suited to different tasks.

00:00:25.657 --> 00:00:31.077
Long data is often easier for grouping, plotting, and scalable storage.

00:00:31.077 --> 00:00:37.062
Wide data is often convenient for human-readable reports or some modeling interfaces.

00:00:37.062 --> 00:00:39.520
Choose the shape required by the next step.
